{"fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T19:01:20.520Z","pushedAt":"2026-10-29T17:28:33Z","branch":"main","issues":301,"watchers":43,"size":69001,"homepage":"https://agentgateway.dev","archived":false,"files":2919,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"\n  \n    \n    \n    <img alt=\"agentgateway\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/refs/heads/main/img/banner-light.svg\" />\n  \n  \n    <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/Apache-2.0\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache2.0-brightgreen.svg?style=flat\" alt=\"License: Apache 2.0\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/agentgateway/agentgateway.svg?style=flat&amp;logo=github&amp;label=Stars\" alt=\"Stars\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/BdJpzaPjHv\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1346225185166065826?style=flat&amp;label=Join%20Discord&amp;color=6D28D9\" alt=\"Discord\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/agentgateway/agentgateway?style=flat&amp;label=Latest%20Release&amp;color=6D28D9\" alt=\"Latest Release\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://deepwiki.com/agentgateway/agentgateway\"><img src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\" alt=\"Ask DeepWiki\" /></a>\n    <a href=\"https://codespaces.new/agentgateway/agentgateway\">\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/codespaces/badge.svg\" alt=\"Open in Github Codespaces\" height=\"20\" />\n    </a>\n  \n  \n    The <strong>first complete</strong> connectivity solution for Agentic AI.\n  \n<hr />\n<p><strong>Agentgateway</strong> is an open source proxy built on AI-native protocols (<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/introduction\">MCP</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/a2a-a-new-era-of-agent-interoperability/\">A2A</a>) that provides drop-in security, observability, and governance for agent-to-LLM, agent-to-tool, and agent-to-agent communication across any framework and environment.</p>\n<br /> \n\n  <img alt=\"agentgateway UI\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/main/img/architecture.svg\" width=\"800\" />\n\n<br /><h2 id=\"intro-to-agentgateway-video\">Intro to Agentgateway Video</h2>\n<br />\n\n  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/SomP92JWPmE\">\n    <img alt=\"Agentgateway Intro Video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/SomP92JWPmE/hqdefault.jpg\" />\n  </a>\n\n<br /><h2 id=\"key-features\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>LLM Gateway</strong><br />\nRoute traffic to major LLM providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Bedrock, and more) through a unified OpenAI-compatible API with budget and spend controls, prompt enrichment, load balancing, and failover.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>MCP Gateway</strong><br />\nConnect LLMs to tools and external data sources via MCP with tool federation, stdio/HTTP/SSE/Streamable HTTP transports, OpenAPI integration, and OAuth authentication.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>A2A Gateway</strong><br />\nEnable secure agent-to-agent communication using A2A, with capability discovery, modality negotiation, and task collaboration.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Inference Routing</strong><br />\nIntelligent routing to self-hosted models using Kubernetes Inference Gateway extensions, with decisions based on GPU utilization, KV cache, LoRA adapters, and queue depth.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Guardrails</strong><br />\nMulti-layered content filtering with regex, OpenAI moderation, AWS Bedrock Guardrails, Google Model Armor, and custom webhooks.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Security &amp; Observability</strong><br />\nAuth (JWT, API keys, OAuth), fine-grained RBAC with CEL policy engine, rate limiting, TLS, and OpenTelemetry metrics/logs/tracing.</p>\n<br /></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started\">Getting Started</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://agentgateway.dev/docs/standalone/latest/documentation/quickstart\">Standalone Quickstart</a> — Get started with agentgateway in minutes.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://agentgateway.dev/docs/kubernetes/latest/documentation/quickstart\">Kubernetes Quickstart</a> — Deploy on Kubernetes using the built-in controller and Gateway API.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"documentation\">Documentation</h2>\n<p>Depending on your deployment environment, check out the following docs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://agentgateway.dev/docs/standalone/latest\">agentgateway.dev/docs</a>: For deployments without the full Kubernetes controller, driven by flat yaml config.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://agentgateway.dev/docs/kubernetes/latest\">agentgateway.dev/docs/kubernetes/latest</a>: For Kubernetes-based deployments using the built-in Kubernetes controller and Gateway API support.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Agentgateway has a built-in UI for you to explore agentgateway connecting agent-to-agent or agent-to-tool:</p>\n\n  <img alt=\"agentgateway UI\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/main/img/UI-homepage.png\" />\n<h2 id=\"sponsors\">Sponsors</h2>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://blacksmith.sh/\">\n        \n          \n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/main/img/blacksmith.svg\" alt=\"Blacksmith\" height=\"48\" />\n        \n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table><p>Thank you to our sponsors for helping to fund the development of agentgateway!</p>\n<h2 id=\"contributing\">Contributing</h2>\n<p>For instructions on how to contribute to the agentgateway project, see the <a href=\"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/blob/main/CONTRIBUTION.md\">CONTRIBUTION.md</a> file.</p>\n<h2 id=\"community-meetings\">Community Meetings</h2>\n<p>To join a community meeting, add the <a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0?cid=Y18zZTAzNGE0OTFiMGUyYzU2OWI1Y2ZlOWNmOWM4NjYyZTljNTNjYzVlOTdmMjdkY2I5ZTZmNmM5ZDZhYzRkM2ZmQGdyb3VwLmNhbGVuZGFyLmdvb2dsZS5jb20\">agentgateway calendar</a> to your Google account. Then, you can find event details on the calendar.</p>\n<p>Recordings of the community meetings will be published on our <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/138716fESpxLkbd_KkGrUHa6TD7OA2tHs?usp=sharing\">google drive</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"roadmap\">Roadmap</h2>\n<p><code>agentgateway</code> is currently in active development. If you'd like a feature that's missing, open an issue in our <a href=\"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/issues\">GitHub repo</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"contributors\">Contributors</h2>\n<p>Thanks to all contributors who are helping to make agentgateway better.</p>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/graphs/contributors\">\n  <img src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=agentgateway/agentgateway\" />\n</a><hr />\n\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/main/img/lf-stacked-color.png\" width=\"300\" alt=\"Linux Foundation logo\" />\n    <p>Agentgateway is a <a href=\"https://www.linuxfoundation.org/\">Linux Foundation</a> project.</p>\n\n","toc":[{"id":"intro-to-agentgateway-video","text":"Intro to Agentgateway Video","level":2},{"id":"key-features","text":"Key Features","level":2},{"id":"getting-started","text":"Getting Started","level":2},{"id":"documentation","text":"Documentation","level":2},{"id":"sponsors","text":"Sponsors","level":2},{"id":"contributing","text":"Contributing","level":2},{"id":"community-meetings","text":"Community Meetings","level":2},{"id":"roadmap","text":"Roadmap","level":2},{"id":"contributors","text":"Contributors","level":2}]},"skills":[],"skillCount":0,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":true,"npm":null,"pypi":null,"install":{},"releases":[{"tag":"v1.7.0","name":"v1.7.0","date":"2026-10-27T17:18:28Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.7.0","pre":false},{"tag":"v1.7.0-rc.1","name":"v1.7.0-rc.1","date":"2026-10-26T19:06:52Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.7.0-rc.1","pre":true},{"tag":"v1.7.0-alpha.1","name":"v1.7.0-alpha.1","date":"2026-10-21T21:31:31Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.7.0-alpha.1","pre":true},{"tag":"v1.6.0","name":"v1.6.0","date":"2026-10-02T16:26:26Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.6.0","pre":false},{"tag":"v1.6.0-rc.1","name":"v1.6.0-rc.1","date":"2026-10-01T22:35:08Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.6.0-rc.1","pre":true},{"tag":"v1.6.0-alpha.2","name":"v1.6.0-alpha.2","date":"2026-09-22T21:27:49Z","url":"https://github.com/agentgateway/agentgateway/releases/tag/v1.6.0-alpha.2","pre":true}],"contributors":[{"login":"howardjohn","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/623453?v=4","n":1315},{"login":"EItanya","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4185086?v=4","n":205},{"login":"npolshakova","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15183287?v=4","n":111},{"login":"markuskobler","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61794?v=4","n":95},{"login":"danehans","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1878195?v=4","n":71},{"login":"stevenctl","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16195656?v=4","n":71},{"login":"chandler-solo","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225927786?v=4","n":66},{"login":"timflannagan","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9899409?v=4","n":65},{"login":"shashankram","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21697719?v=4","n":54},{"login":"jenshu","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28537278?v=4","n":51},{"login":"iandvt","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25870869?v=4","n":40},{"login":"keithmattix","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1531662?v=4","n":39}]}
